{"text": "One day an elder sister came from town to visit her younger sister, who lived in a village with her husband. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Drinking tea together, the elder sister began to boast about the town, where people dressed well and ate fine food. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The younger sister did not like this, and she said that she would never change her life for her sisters. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Our life may be rough, but we are never anxious, and we always have enough to eat, she said proudly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You town people may be rich today, but tomorrow you could lose everything and end up on the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The elder sister laughed and answered that peasants lived in dirt all their lives and died in it, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pahom, the master of the house, was lying on top of the stove, where he listened to the womens talk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is true, he thought, we peasants are too busy with our work to think of any nonsense. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Our only trouble is that we have too little land, and if I had plenty of land, I would not fear the Devil himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Devil, who had been sitting behind the stove, heard everything and decided to give Pahom land and to trap him through it.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "a", "n", " ", "e", "l", "d", "e", "r", " ", "s", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "o", "w", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "v", "i", "s", "i", "t", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", "e", "r", " ", "s", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "v", "i", "l", "l", "a", "g", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "u", "s", "b", "a", "n", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "r", "i", "n", "